xfwm4-gl (4.20.0+gl1+git20261009.af5f68f-0minios2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Load the busy cursor through the active Xcursor theme and size instead of a
    fixed monochrome bitmap, following cursor-theme and HiDPI updates.
  * Support Fade and Scale + Fade opening/closing, Scale + Fade minimize/restore,
    and visual-only Peek with XRender, sharing timing, geometry and Peek state
    with OpenGL. Keep Magic Lamp and backdrop blur exclusive to OpenGL.
  * Preserve the published upstream snapshot archive and record MiniOS source
    modifications in a generated Debian quilt patch.

 -- crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 03:15:57 +0300

xfwm4-gl (4.20.0+gl1+git20261009.af5f68f-0minios1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add configurable OpenGL backdrop blur for panels, translucent applications,
    tasklist previews, Alt+Tab, menus, tooltips and notifications, with native
    popup shadows and blur that follows content bounds and window opacity.
  * Add OpenGL opening/closing animations with Scale + Fade or Fade, and
    minimize/restore animations with Scale + Fade or Magic Lamp, with adjustable
    durations.
  * Add OpenGL Peek for tasklist hover and Alt+Tab to dim or hide other windows
    and preview cached minimized windows without activating them.
  * Share native window outlines and optional interior highlighting between
    Alt+Tab and tasklist hover, including XRender and non-composited sessions.
  * Share themed window-switcher and tasklist preview styling; add switcher
    controls for colors, opacity, borders, corners, spacing, padding, thumbnail
    dimensions and selection highlighting.
  * Add separate resets for window-switcher appearance and compositor settings.
  * Support global interface scaling for window decorations and preserve window
    positions and restore geometry when the scale changes.

 -- crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 02:36:32 +0300

